msgid "Wayland/X11"
msgstr "Wayland/X11"

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "總覽"

msgid ""
"One of the important components of any operating system is its display "
"server. Windows, macOS, iOS, visionOS, and Android only provide one option. "
"However, Linux has two options: X11 and Wayland."
msgstr ""
"任何作業系統的重要組成部分之一都是其顯示伺服器。Windows、macOS、iOS、"
"VisionOS 和 Android 均僅提供單一選項；而 Linux 則提供兩種選項：X11 和 "
"Wayland。"

msgid ""
"X11 is an older standard and is being gradually phased out by the majority "
"of Linux distributions in favor of supporting Wayland, which has been "
"developed as a replacement. Wayland aims to provide modern functionality "
"while featuring a more robust security model compared to X11. Applications "
"running on X11 can still work when a distribution is using Wayland, thanks "
"to a compatibility layer known as Xwayland."
msgstr ""
"X11 是一項較早的圖形介面標準，目前大多數 Linux 發行版正逐步棄用該標準，轉而支"
"援作為其替代方案而開發的 Wayland。Wayland 旨在提供現代化的功能，同時相較於 "
"X11 具備更 robust 的安全模型。當發行版採用 Wayland 時，基於 X11 執行的應用程"
"式仍可正常工作——這得益於一個名為 Xwayland 的相容層。"

msgid ""
"Godot's support is still a work in progress, so for now, X11 remains the "
"default setting for projects. This will likely change in a future version."
msgstr ""
"Godot 的支援功能仍在不斷完善中，因此目前專案預設使用 X11；這一設定可能會在未"
"來的版本中發生變化。"

msgid "When to use Wayland"
msgstr "Wayland 的適用場景"

msgid ""
"If you're an engine developer who wants to help improve support, or if you "
"think Xwayland might be causing visual glitches in your exported project for "
"whatever reason, then we would recommend using Wayland. But outside of that "
"it's recommended to stick with X11 for now. It's important to note that "
"while X11 applications can run on Wayland, the reverse is not true."
msgstr ""
"如果你是希望協助改進支援的引擎開發人員，或者你認為 Xwayland 可能因某些原因導"
"致匯出的專案出現視覺瑕疵，那麼我們建議你使用 Wayland。但除此之外，目前仍建議"
"堅持使用 X11。需要注意的是，雖然 X11 應用程式可以在 Wayland 上執行，但反過來"
"卻不成立。"

msgid ""
"As of June 2026, most popular distributions are using Wayland by default, "
"including (but not limited to) the following:"
msgstr ""
"自 2026 年 6 月起，大多數主流發行版均預設採用 Wayland，包括但不限於以下發行"
"版："

msgid "SteamOS"
msgstr "SteamOS"

msgid "Bazzite"
msgstr "Bazzite"

msgid "CachyOS"
msgstr "CachyOS"

msgid "Fedora"
msgstr "Fedora"

msgid "Fedora Silverblue"
msgstr "Fedora Silverblue"

msgid "Ubuntu"
msgstr "Ubuntu"

msgid "OpenSUSE"
msgstr "OpenSUSE"

msgid ""
"Keep in mind that for some distributions like Ubuntu, users may have changed "
"the display server to X11 manually themselves."
msgstr ""
"請注意，對於某些發行版（例如 Ubuntu），使用者可能已自行手動將顯示伺服器更改"
"為 X11。"

msgid "Changing the display server setting"
msgstr "更改顯示伺服器設定"

msgid ""
"To change your display server to Wayland, click on :menu:`Project > Project "
"Settings`, from here, go to :button:`Display Server` and change "
"the :button:`driver.linuxbsd` option to ``wayland``."
msgstr ""
"如需將顯示伺服器更改為 Wayland，請點擊：:menu:`Project > Project Settings` ，"
"然後選擇：:button:`Display Server` ，並將：:button:`driver.linuxbsd` 選項更改"
"為 ``wayland`` 。"

msgid ""
"It's also possible to temporarily override the display server using the ``--"
"display-server <x11|wayland>`` :ref:`command line argument "
"<doc_command_line_tutorial>` when launching the project."
msgstr ""
"在啟動專案時，還可通過使用 ``--display-server <x11|wayland>`` :ref:`command "
"line argument <doc_command_line_tutorial>` 來暫時覆蓋顯示伺服器。"

msgid ""
"Regardless of how the display server is defined, if the project is "
"configured to use Wayland, it will automatically fall back to X11 if Wayland "
"is not available."
msgstr ""
"無論顯示伺服器如何定義，若專案設定為使用 Wayland，則在 Wayland 不可用時將自動"
"切換回 X11。"

msgid ""
"This also occurs the other way around; if the project is configured to use "
"X11, it will fall back to Wayland if X11 is not available (i.e. when "
"Xwayland isn't present on the system)."
msgstr ""
"這種情況也可能發生於相反的情形：如果專案設定為使用 X11，則在 X11 無法使用時"
"（即系統上未安裝 Xwayland 時），系統將回退至 Wayland。"

msgid "Disabling libdecor loading"
msgstr "停用 libdecor 載入"

